    "standardized_narrative": "At 1 January 2023 the syndicate's gross claims outstanding were GBP 596.9m. During 2023 the syndicate reported an overall net surplus in ultimate claims of GBP 23.0m, driven by favourable claims development across multiple classes (notably positive back-year movement in casualty and motor/auto lines). Key prior-year exposures such as Hurricane Ian (2022) and Hurricane Ida (2021) remain materially reserved but are largely mitigated by the reinsurance programme; Covid-19 and a range of historical catastrophes are discussed as continuing sources of uncertainty.",
    "raw_causal_phrases": [
      "In 2023, there has been an overall net surplus in ultimate claims of GBP 23.0m (2022: GBP 7.0m deficit) due to higher than expected incurred movements across most classes of business.",
